WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.960 line:73%
Umuulan. May silbi
pa ba ang solar mo?

c02
00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:06.080 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.520 line:73%
Oo, pero mas
mahina ang output.

c04
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:12.560 line:73%
Kapag maulap, nababawasan
ang liwanag sa panels.

c05
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.350 line:73%
Kaya bumababa ang output,
minsan malaki ang bawas.

c06
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.120 line:73%
Pero madalas hindi zero, dahil
may diffuse light pa rin.

c07
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.930 line:73%
Ang tamang tingin: kWh sa
buong buwan, hindi isang araw.

cz1
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:31.810 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.570 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
